se,"ar":"Digitals","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Wed Jan 13, 11:00 AM Paris (Wed Jan 13 5:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-13T12:00:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"digitals"},{"i":"g90:deborah-adegoke:DGu","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals up and comp card updated (Deborah Adegoke)","d":"Upload the digitals, update the comp card and measurements, and tell the mother agency.","u":"2027-01-15T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 15, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:deborah-adegoke:DGs","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals sent to mother agency and top clients (Deborah Adegoke)","d":"Send the new digitals to the mother agency and the casting directors on this season's list.","u":"2027-01-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"casting_show","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:deborah-adegoke:SK4","a":"model","o":"Deborah Adegoke","t":"Skin submission #4 (check): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:deborah-adegoke:SK4e","a":"model","o":"Deborah Adegoke","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"}]},{"name":"Feuza Diouf","gp":{"title":"90-Day Gameplan: Nov 8, 2026 to Feb 5, 2027","key_date":"2027-01-25","key_label":"Paris Haute Couture SS27","welcome":"Welcome to your 90-day gameplan, Feuza. Every task has a date and a time in your own time zone. Tap Complete when a task is done, or request a new date with a note. Your agent is Erica.","positioning":"Runway: Paris Haute Couture SS27 (Mon Jan 25 to Thu Jan 28); Paris Women's FW27-28 (Mon Mar 1 to Tue Mar 9).","market":"Base: Paris. Shows: Paris Haute Couture SS27, Paris Women's FW27-28.","image_rules":"Test shoots: 2 in this block. Fresh digitals close to your first show. Skin photos four times (Nov 16, Dec 14, pre-show, Feb 1). Nothing is posted or sent without your approval of the selects.","risks":"","cadence":{"daily":"Skin routine morning and night, food and water, sleep 8 hours","walk":"Tuesday and Thursday 30 minutes","weekly":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","deadlines":"All dates and times are in your gameplan tasks"}},"ds":{"built":"2026-11-08","until":"2027-02-05","blocks":[{"id":"gp_snack1","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"10:30","end":"10:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_snack2","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"15:30","end":"15:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_walk","days":["2","4"],"start":"18:00","end":"18:30","title":"Walk practice (gameplan)","cat":"model","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_checkin","days":["0"],"start":"17:00","end":"17:20","title":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","cat":"routine","until":"2027-02-05"}],"habits":[{"id":"gp_skin","label":"Skin plan from your gameplan: morning and night"},{"id":"gp_fuel","label":"Fueling plan: protein at every meal, two snacks, water"},{"id":"gp_walk","label":"Walk practice Tuesday and Thursday"},{"id":"gp_sleep","label":"Sleep 8 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"},{"k":"gp_walkvid","t":"Walk video due dates: Nov 23, Dec 14 and your pre-show date"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Gameplan live for Feuza Diouf","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:G1","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: Paris Haute Couture SS27, Paris Women's FW27-28.","u":"2026-11-13T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Paris (Fri Nov 13 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:SK1","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-16T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:SK1e","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Feuza Diouf)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Feuza)","d":"Shoot is Thu Dec 3, 2026, 9:00 AM Paris at Paris studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Feuza and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-19T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Nov 19, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:H1","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM Paris (Fri Nov 20 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:SKP","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: cool, damp winter and indoor heating. Use a ceramide cream at night, run a humidifier where you sleep, and keep SPF on even when it is cloudy. Pre-show protocol (starts 14 days before your first show): no new active products, no peels, lasers, waxing or fillers in the last 7 days, no sunburn or tanning, sleep 8 hours, and remove all makeup at the end of every day. If anything flares, tell your agent the same day. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:WK1","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Walk video #1: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:WK1e","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Walk practice video #1 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy picks: eggs, yogurt or skyr, oats, fish, lentil or bean soups, whole-grain bread, roasted vegetables and fruit. In Paris, bakeries and markets make it simple to pair a protein with a fruit or vegetable. Show weeks: carry snacks (nuts, fruit, a protein bar, a sandwich), eat before every call time, keep water with you, and keep caffeine and alcohol low the night before a casting or show.","u":"2026-11-25T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM Paris (Wed Nov 25 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Feuza Diouf)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Feuza Diouf)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Thu Dec 3, 2026.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Feuza)","d":"Call sheet to Feuza and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Paris, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-11-30T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 30, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Thu Dec 3, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-12-01T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Tue Dec 1, 5:00 PM Paris (Tue Dec 1 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS1","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Test shoot 1: Feuza","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Paris studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-03T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Thu Dec 3, 9:00 AM Paris (Thu Dec 3 3:00 AM ET)","en":"2026-12-03T16:00:00Z","loc":"Paris studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS1-selects","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: send selects (Feuza)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-12-07T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 7, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS1-approve","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Approve your test shoot 1 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2026-12-09T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Wed Dec 9, 5:00 PM Paris (Wed Dec 9 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS1-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 selects (Feuza Diouf)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2026-12-09T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 9, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:SK2","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Skin submission #2 (progress): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:SK2e","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Skin submission #2 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:WK2","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Walk video #2: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:WK2e","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Walk practice video #2 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS1-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: retouched finals delivered (Feuza)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS1-package","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: add to book and push the package (Feuza)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2026-12-16T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 16, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:H2","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Physical exam and bloodwork: done and cleared","d":"Physical exam and bloodwork as your clinician advises (iron, vitamin D, B12 and thyroid are common for travel season), a dental cleaning and a vision check, all by the dates in your gameplan. You choose what to share: MDV only needs 'cleared' or 'not cleared', never your results. Due Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Paris (Fri Dec 18 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-18T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Health","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Paris (Fri Dec 18 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:H2e","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Health layout due: physical, dental, vision","d":"Tell your agent you are cleared.","u":"2026-12-18T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Paris (Fri Dec 18 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:H3","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Dental cleaning and vision check: done","d":"Book both and tell your agent 'done'. Bring glasses or contact prescriptions if you use them.","u":"2026-12-18T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Paris (Fri Dec 18 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS2-team","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Feuza)","d":"Shoot is Thu Jan 7, 2027, 9:00 AM Paris at Paris studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Feuza and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-12-24T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h