},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:SK3","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Skin submission #3 (pre-show): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Jan 11 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-01-11T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Jan 11 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:SK3e","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Skin submission #3 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-11T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Jan 11 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:WK3","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Walk video #3: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Jan 11 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-01-11T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Jan 11 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:WK3e","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Walk practice video #3 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-11T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Jan 11 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS2-selects","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: send selects (Feuza)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2027-01-11T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS2-approve","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Approve your test shoot 2 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2027-01-13T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Wed Jan 13, 5:00 PM Paris (Wed Jan 13 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS2-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 selects (Feuza Diouf)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2027-01-13T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Jan 13, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:WKOFF","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Walk-off with your agent (Feuza)","d":"In-person walk check with your agent: straight walk, turns, pace and shoes. About 45 minutes.","u":"2027-01-18T09:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Jan 18, 10:00 AM Paris (Mon Jan 18 4:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-18T09:45:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS2-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: retouched finals delivered (Feuza)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2027-01-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:DG","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Digitals session (Feuza)","d":"Fresh digitals for casting: clean face, fitted plain clothes, hair back, no jewelry. Front, profile, back, full length, smile and walk video.","u":"2027-01-20T10:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Wed Jan 20, 11:00 AM Paris (Wed Jan 20 5:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-20T12:00:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"digitals"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:TS2-package","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: add to book and push the package (Feuza)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2027-01-20T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Jan 20, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:DGu","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals up and comp card updated (Feuza Diouf)","d":"Upload the digitals, update the comp card and measurements, and tell the mother agency.","u":"2027-01-22T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 22, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:DGs","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals sent to mother agency and top clients (Feuza Diouf)","d":"Send the new digitals to the mother agency and the casting directors on this season's list.","u":"2027-01-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"casting_show","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:SK4","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Skin submission #4 (check): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:feuza-diouf:SK4e","a":"model","o":"Feuza Diouf","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"}]},{"name":"Lance Valadie","gp":{"title":"90-Day Gameplan: Nov 8, 2026 to Feb 5, 2027","key_date":"2027-01-19","key_label":"Paris Men's FW27-28","welcome":"Welcome to your 90-day gameplan, Lance. Every task has a date and a time in your own time zone. Tap Complete when a task is done, or request a new date with a note. Your agent is Emma.","positioning":"Runway: Paris Men's FW27-28 (Tue Jan 19 to Sun Jan 24); New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14) (Wed Feb 10 to Tue Feb 16).","market":"Base: New York. Shows: Paris Men's FW27-28, New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14).","image_rules":"Test shoots: 2 in this block. Fresh digitals close to your first show. Skin photos four times (Nov 16, Dec 14, pre-show, Feb 1). Nothing is posted or sent without your approval of the selects.","risks":"","cadence":{"daily":"Skin routine morning and night, food and water, sleep 8 hours","walk":"Tuesday and Thursday 30 minutes","weekly":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","deadlines":"All dates and times are in your gameplan tasks"}},"ds":{"built":"2026-11-08","until":"2027-02-05","blocks":[{"id":"gp_snack1","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"10:30","end":"10:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_snack2","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"15:30","end":"15:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_walk","days":["2","4"],"start":"18:00","end":"18:30","title":"Walk practice (gameplan)","cat":"model","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_checkin","days":["0"],"start":"17:00","end":"17:20","title":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","cat":"routine","until":"2027-02-05"}],"habits":[{"id":"gp_skin","label":"Skin plan from your gameplan: morning and night"},{"id":"gp_fuel","label":"Fueling plan: protein at every meal, two snacks, water"},{"id":"gp_walk","label":"Walk practice Tuesday and Thursday"},{"id":"gp_sleep","label":"Sleep 8 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"},{"k":"gp_walkvid","t":"Walk video due dates: Nov 23, Dec 14 and your pre-show date"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Gameplan live for Lance Valadie","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:G1","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: Paris Men's FW27-28, New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14).","u":"2026-11-13T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:SK1","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-11-16T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:SK1e","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Lance Valadie)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Lance)","d":"Shoot is Wed Dec 2, 2026, 9:00 AM ET at New York studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Lance and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:H1","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:SKP","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: cold, dry winter. Use a richer cream, lip balm at night, lukewarm (not hot) water, and a hydrating mask twice a week. SPF stays on. Pre-show protocol (starts 14 days before your first show): no new active products, no peels, lasers, waxing or fillers in the last 7 days, no sunburn or tanning, sleep 8 hours, and remove all makeup at the end of every day. If anything flares, tell your agent the same day. Travel days: cleanse, put on a thick moisturizer, no new products, drink water through the flight, and use a hydrating mask after landing. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:WK1","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Walk video #1: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:WK1e","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Walk practice video #1 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Lance Valadie)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Lance Valadie)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Wed Dec 2, 2026.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy picks: bowls with a grilled protein, a whole grain and vegetables; eggs, Greek yogurt, oats, fruit and nuts. Show weeks: carry snacks (nuts, fruit, a protein bar, a sandwich), eat before every call time, keep water with you, and keep caffeine and alcohol low the night before a casting or show.","u":"2026-11-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Lance)","d":"Call sheet to Lance and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM ET, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-11-27T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 27, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Wed Dec 2, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-11-30T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 30, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TS1","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Test shoot 1: Lance","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. New York studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-02T14:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 2, 9:00 AM ET","en":"2026-12-02T22:00:00Z","loc":"New York studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TS1-selects","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send selects (Lance)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-12-04T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 4, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TR-offer","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Send travel and stay offer to Lance Valadie and mother agency","d":"Itinerary: Paris Thu Jan 14 to Mon Jan 25 (Paris Men's). Estimated total $2,250 (flights $900, housing $605, meals and transport $420, transfers $120, visa and insurance $0, 10% contingency). Replace the estimate with real quotes first.","u":"2026-12-07T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 7, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TS1-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 selects (Lance Valadie)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2026-12-08T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 8, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TS1-approve","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Approve your test shoot 1 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2026-12-08T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 8, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:PA4","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Co-sign travel advance and recoup terms (Lance Valadie)","d":"Estimated travel and stay about $2,250. Please confirm you accept the advance and how it is recouped.","u":"2026-12-11T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TR-approve","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Approve your travel and stay plan: about $2,250","d":"Your season itinerary: Paris Thu Jan 14 to Mon Jan 25 (Paris Men's). Estimated total $2,250: flights $900, housing $605, meals and local transport $420, airport transfers $120, visa and insurance $0, contingency $205. This is an estimate until tickets are booked; final numbers are shown before anything is charged. Tap Complete to approve, or request a change with a note. Due Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-12-11T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM ET","amt":2250},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TR-approve-e","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Travel plan approval due","d":"Approve the travel and stay estimate (about $2,250).","u":"2026-12-11T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"travel"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TS1-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: retouched finals delivered (Lance)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-11T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TR-fund","a":"staff","o":"Sophia","t":"Release travel advance after approvals (Lance Valadie)","d":"Only after the model and mother agency approve. Estimated $2,250.","u":"2026-12-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:SK2","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Skin submission #2 (progress): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:SK2e","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Skin submission #2 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:WK2","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Walk video #2: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:WK2e","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Walk practice video #2 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TS1-package","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: add to book and push the package (Lance)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2026-12-15T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 15, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:TR-tix","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Tickets issued for Lance Valadie","d":"Book flights only when the visa (if needed) is in the passport and the travel plan is approved. Send e-tickets to the model and mother agency.","u":"2026-12-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:H2","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Physical exam and bloodwork: done and cleared","d":"Physical exam and bloodwork as your clinician advises (iron, vitamin D, B12 and thyroid are common for travel season), a dental cleaning and a vision check, all by the dates in your gameplan. You choose what to share: MDV only needs 'cleared' or 'not cleared', never your results. Travel health: ask your clinician about vaccines or medicines for your route, carry a copy of prescriptions, and bring your insurance card. Due Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:H2e","a":"model","o":"Lance Valadie","t":"Health layout due: physical, dental, vision","d":"Tell your agent you are cleared.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:lance-valadie:H3",