 height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:rachel-obaterin:WK2e","a":"model","o":"Rachel Obaterin","t":"Walk practice video #2 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:rachel-obaterin:TR-fund","a":"staff","o":"Sophia","t":"Release travel advance after approvals (Rachel Obaterin)","d":"Only after the model and mother agency approve. Estimated $8,019.","u":"2026-12-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:rachel-obaterin:TS1-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: retouched finals delivered (Rachel)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-14T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:rachel-obaterin:TS2","a":"model","o":"Rachel Obaterin","t":"Test shoot 2: Rachel","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Lagos studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-15T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Tue Dec 15, 9:00 AM Lagos (Tue Dec 15 3:00 AM ET)","en":"2026-12-15T16:00:00Z","loc":"Lagos studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:rachel-obaterin:TS1-package","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: add to book and push the package (Rachel)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2026-12-16T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":