ell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2026-12-21T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 21, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 21 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:rachel-obaterin:TS2-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 selects (Rachel Obaterin)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2026-12-21T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 21, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:rachel-obaterin:V5","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"VISA DECISION DEADLINE (Rachel Obaterin)","d":"If there is no decision today, escalate to Demontez the same hour and switch to the fallback (Milan placement, or Women's only).","u":"2026-12-21T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 21, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:rachel-obaterin:V6","a":"model","o":"Rachel Obaterin","t":"Collect your passport and check the visa","d":"Check name, dates, number of entries and the dates you can stay. Send a photo of the visa page.","u":"2026-12-28T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 28, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 28 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:rachel-obaterin:TS2-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: retouched finals delivered (Rachel)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-28T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 28, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:rachel-obaterin:TR-tix","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Tickets issued for Rachel Obaterin","d":"Book flights only when the visa (if needed) is in the passport and the travel plan is approved. Send e-tickets to the model and mother agency.","u":"2026-12-30T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 30, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:rachel-obaterin:TS2-pa