shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 16, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:TS2-selects","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: send selects (Samuel)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-12-16T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 16, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:H2","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Physical exam and bloodwork: done and cleared","d":"Physical exam and bloodwork as your clinician advises (iron, vitamin D, B12 and thyroid are common for travel season), a dental cleaning and a vision check, all by the dates in your gameplan. You choose what to share: MDV only needs 'cleared' or 'not cleared', never your results. Travel health: ask your clinician about vaccines or medicines for your route, carry a copy of prescriptions, and bring your insurance card. Due Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Dec 18 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-18T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Health","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Dec 18 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:H2e","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Health layout due: physical, dental, vision","d":"Tell your agent you are cleared.","u":"2026-12-18T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Dec 18 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:H3","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Dental cleaning and vision check: done","d":"Book both and tell your agent 'done'. Bring glasses or contact prescriptions if you use them.","u":"2026-12-18T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Dec 18 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:TS2-approve","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Approve your test shoot 2 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2026-12-18T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Dec 18 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:TS2-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 selects (Samuel Yusuf)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2026-12-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:V5","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"VISA DECISION DEADLINE (Samuel Yusuf)","d":"If there is no decision today, escalate to Demontez the same hour and switch to the fallback (Milan placement, or Women's only).","u":"2026-12-21T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 21, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:TS2-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: retouched finals delivered (Samuel)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 23, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:V6","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Collect your passport and check the visa","d":"Check name, dates, number of entries and the dates you can stay. Send a photo of the visa page.","u":"2026-12-28T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 28, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 28 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:TS2-package","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: add to book and push the package (Samuel)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2026-12-29T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 29, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:TR-tix","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Tickets issued for Samuel Yusuf","d":"Book flights only when the visa (if needed) is in the passport and the travel plan is approved. Send e-tickets to the model and mother agency.","u":"2026-12-30T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 30, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:SK3","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Skin submission #3 (pre-show): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Jan 4, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Jan 4 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-01-04T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Jan 4, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Jan 4 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:SK3e","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Skin submission #3 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-04T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Jan 4, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Jan 4 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:WK3","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Walk video #3: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Jan 4, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Jan 4 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-01-04T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Jan 4, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Jan 4 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i