0Z","k":"e","ty":"travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Sun Jan 10, 12:00 PM Paris (Sun Jan 10 6:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":"Paris","ek":"arrival"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:WKOFF","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Walk-off with your agent (Samuel)","d":"In-person walk check with your agent: straight walk, turns, pace and shoes. About 45 minutes.","u":"2027-01-11T09:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Jan 11, 10:00 AM Paris (Mon Jan 11 4:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-11T09:45:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:DG","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Digitals session (Samuel)","d":"Fresh digitals for casting: clean face, fitted plain clothes, hair back, no jewelry. Front, profile, back, full length, smile and walk video.","u":"2027-01-13T10:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Wed Jan 13, 11:00 AM Paris (Wed Jan 13 5:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-13T12:00:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"digitals"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:DGu","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals up and comp card updated (Samuel Yusuf)","d":"Upload the digitals, update the comp card and measurements, and tell the mother agency.","u":"2027-01-15T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 15, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:DGs","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals sent to mother agency and top clients (Samuel Yusuf)","d":"Send the new digitals to the mother agency and the casting directors on this season's list.","u":"2027-01-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"casting_show","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:SK4","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Skin submission #4 (check): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:samuel-yusuf:SK4e","a":"model","o":"Samuel Yusuf","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"}]},{"name":"Vayla Bovykina","gp":{"title":"90-Day Gameplan: Nov 8, 2026 to Feb 5, 2027","key_date":"2027-03-15","key_label":"Spring editorial window opens","welcome":"Welcome to your 90-day gameplan, Vayla. Every task has a date and a time in your own time zone. Tap Complete when a task is done, or request a new date with a note. Your agent is Erica.","positioning":"Editorial and print focus this season. No runway push.","market":"Base: Seoul. Editorial and campaign bookings; spring window opens Mar 15.","image_rules":"Test shoots: 2 in this block. Fresh digitals close to your first show. Skin photos four times (Nov 16, Dec 14, pre-show, Feb 1). Nothing is posted or sent without your approval of the selects.","risks":"Currently in Seoul.","cadence":{"daily":"Skin routine morning and night, food and water, sleep 8 hours","walk":"Pose practice, two check dates","weekly":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","deadlines":"All dates and times are in your gameplan tasks"}},"ds":{"built":"2026-11-08","until":"2027-02-05","blocks":[{"id":"gp_snack1","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"10:30","end":"10:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_snack2","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"15:30","end":"15:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_walk","days":["2","4"],"start":"18:00","end":"18:30","title":"Pose practice (gameplan)","cat":"model","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_checkin","days":["0"],"start":"17:00","end":"17:20","title":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","cat":"routine","until":"2027-02-05"}],"habits":[{"id":"gp_skin","label":"Skin plan from your gameplan: morning and night"},{"id":"gp_fuel","label":"Fueling plan: protein at every meal, two snacks, water"},{"id":"gp_walk","label":"Pose practice Tuesday and Thursday"},{"id":"gp_sleep","label":"Sleep 8 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Gameplan live for Vayla Bovykina","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:G1","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: editorial and print focus.","u":"2026-11-13T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Nov 13 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:SK1","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 16 3:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-16T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 16 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:SK1e","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 16 3:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Vayla Bovykina)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:H1","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM Seoul (Fri Nov 20 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:PO1","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Pose sheet #1: send your 10 poses","d":"Editorial practice (no runway push): 10 poses in 3 looks in front of a mirror, plus 5 expressions for close-ups. Send a 10-pose contact sheet each check date. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 23 3:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-23T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 23 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:SKP","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: cold, dry winter. Use a richer cream, lip balm at night, lukewarm (not hot) water, and a hydrating mask twice a week. SPF stays on. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Nov 23 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy picks: bibimbap with extra vegetables and egg, grilled fish, tofu stew, seaweed soup, kimchi and fruit.","u":"2026-11-25T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM Seoul (Wed Nov 25 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Vayla Bovykina)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Vayla)","d":"Shoot is Fri Dec 11, 2026, 9:00 AM Seoul at Seoul studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Vayla and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-27T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 27, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Vayla Bovykina)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Fri Dec 11, 2026.","u":"2026-12-04T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 4, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Vayla)","d":"Call sheet to Vayla and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Seoul, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-12-08T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 8, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Fri Dec 11, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-12-09T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Wed Dec 9, 5:00 PM Seoul (Wed Dec 9 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:TS1","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Test shoot 1: Vayla","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Seoul studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-11T00:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Fri Dec 11, 9:00 AM Seoul (Thu Dec 10 7:00 PM ET)","en":"2026-12-11T08:00:00Z","loc":"Seoul studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:PO2","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Pose sheet #2: send your 10 poses","d":"Editorial practice (no runway push): 10 poses in 3 looks in front of a mirror, plus 5 expressions for close-ups. Send a 10-pose contact sheet each check date. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Dec 14 3:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Dec 14 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:SK2","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Skin submission #2 (progress): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Dec 14 3:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T08:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Dec 14 3:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:SK2e","a":"model","o":"Vayla Bovykina","t":"Skin submission #2 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Seoul","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Seoul (Mon Dec 14 3:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:TS1-selects","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: send selects (Vayla)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-12-15T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 15, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:vayla-bovykina:TS1-approve","a